        "created_at": "2015-03-15T23:59:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OK, then I'm going to officially take that as the official position, officially speaking. &nbsp;You can play bounties and ammo cards if there isn't a proper target in play, but it goes directly to the trash and isn't considered to have been destroyed.</p>",
