        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-18T15:42:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"The card goes to the trash but is not destroyed.\" Is it still considered to have entered play (for effects that trigger when cards enter play)?&nbsp; Or does it completely circumvent entering play and leaving play (ie it not destroyed)?</p>",
