        "raw": "<p>@Sefirit</p><p>i would believe it would be similar to being forced to play a limited card in that you don&#39;t get any of the enter play affects</p><p>@trajector</p><p>yes, you can continue to play more cards on a target regardless of how many it Ongoings or equipment it has on it. &nbsp;So Twist the Ether could still be played on that target.&nbsp;</p>",
